  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your vicious opponent digs its way through a couple of your upper ribs. The top of your lung is punctured, either by bone splinters or your foe’s sharp natural implements. It partly collapses as air and blood leak into the pleural space, leaving you gasping for air.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Fatigued] (2) which drops to @Condition[Fatigued] (1) after the end of the encounter. Because it’s only a rather minor pneumothorax you’ll get to remove the last @Condition[Fatigued] Condition after one week as the lung inflates itself back again.</p>"
    },
